OL,3,GNEWSANew cancer service reduces
OL,4,Aduration of treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has revealed a new service
OL,7,Fwhich allows patients with advanced
OL,8,Fcancer to receive treatment more
OL,9,Fquickly and removes the requirement for
OL,10,Fa night in hospital.
OL,12,FThe Royal Surrey NHS Foundation Trust
OL,13,Freceived funding which paid for the
OL,14,Fnurse-led service at the Chilworth Day
OL,15,FUnit.
OL,17,FPreviously, patients admitted for
OL,18,Ftreatment to drain fluid spent an
OL,19,Faverage of just over four and a half
OL,20,Fdays in hospital, but now they can
OL,21,Freturn home on the same day.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
