OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew cancer service reduces
OL,4,Aduration of treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Masters, lead nurse for systemic
OL,7,Fanti-cancer therapy at the Royal Surrey
OL,8,FCounty Hospital, said: "Being able to
OL,9,Foffer patients quicker treatment, ease
OL,10,Ftheir symptoms and help them return
OL,11,Fhome the same day has been enormously
OL,12,Frewarding."
